--- !u!114 &7698694607240921059
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4328587973045283718}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e221a66a5e0b02845bae96e3770be3b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AIAdventure.Level.Note
  title: "Kaz\u0131 G\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC \u2014 Son Sayfa"
  body: "K\xE2tip'i yendim. Kap\u0131 a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131 ve onu g\xF6rd\xFCm: Baron Mortis. Masada eski bir tabanca vard\u0131. Alt\u0131 hazne, tek kur\u015Fun. \"S\u0131ra sende,\" dedi g\xFCl\xFCmseyerek.\n\nAma bir \u015Fey fark ettim: o da korkuyor. Her konu\u015Ftu\u011Fumda parmaklar\u0131 masada t\u0131k\u0131rd\u0131yordu. Baron'u \u015Fans de\u011Fil, s\xF6zler yener. Onu konu\u015Fturan, sinirlerini bozan kazan\u0131r.\n\nBen cesaretimi kaybettim. Bunu okuyan sen, kaybetme.\n\n\u2014 L."
