  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e221a66a5e0b02845bae96e3770be3b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AIAdventure.Level.Note
  title: "Duvar Yaz\u0131t\u0131 (kopya)"
  body: "Talihin \xFC\xE7 kap\u0131s\u0131 vard\u0131r.\n\nBirincisi k\xFC\xE7\xFCklere a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r; iri olan ge\xE7emez.\n\u0130kincisi kartlara a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r; yirmi biri a\u015Fan yanar.\n\xDC\xE7\xFCnc\xFCs\xFC alt\u0131 hazneye a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r; orada ya cesaret kazan\u0131r ya kur\u015Fun.\n\n\xDC\xE7 kap\u0131y\u0131 da a\xE7an, Baron'un masas\u0131ndan \xF6zg\xFCr kalkar."
